---
---
<section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-[#e5dce7]" id="apps">
<div class="bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#e5dce7] rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">

<div class="lg:col-span-7">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-[#4c1268]">Mobile Ecosystem</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#231429] mb-3 tracking-tight">
              AISLEY on the go.
            </h2>
<p class="text-base text-[#594c5e] mb-6">Find Buyer and Rider mobile app releases on GitHub. Review the release notes, available packages, and installation instructions.</p>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">

<div class="border border-[#e5dce7] rounded-lg p-4 bg-[#f7f5f7] flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
<span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#231429]">Buyer Application</span>
</div>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e] mb-3">Shop and follow your orders on mobile.</p>
</div>
<a class="min-h-[44px] w-full px-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#cfc1d2] hover:bg-[#f1ebf3] hover:border-[#4c1268] text-[#231429] text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#4c1268] focus-visible:outline-none" href="https://github.com/ApueXI/aisley-app-customer/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
<span class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
                  Buyer app releases
                </a>
</div>

<div class="border border-[#bfdbfe] rounded-lg p-4 bg-[#eff6ff]/40 flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
<span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#231429]">Rider Application</span>
</div>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e] mb-3">Access courier pickup and delivery workflows.</p>
</div>
<a class="min-h-[44px] w-full px-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#bfdbfe] hover:bg-[#eff6ff] text-[#2563eb] text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#2563eb] focus-visible:outline-none" href="https://github.com/ApueXI/aisley-app-rider/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
<span class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
                  Rider app releases
                </a>
</div>
</div>

<div class="bg-[#f1ebf3] border border-[#e5dce7] rounded-lg p-3 text-xs text-[#594c5e]">
<span class="font-bold text-[#231429]">Courier access:</span> Couriers use the Rider mobile app and require approval from their associated Logistics organization. Sellers and Logistics teams use their dedicated web portals.
            </div>
</div>

<div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-[#f7f5f7] border border-[#e5dce7] rounded-lg p-5 space-y-4">
<div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7d6f83] uppercase tracking-wider">Before you download</div>
<div class="border-b border-[#e5dce7] pb-3">
<div class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#231429]">Available packages</div>
<div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#594c5e] mt-0.5">Check the selected release</div>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-[#e5dce7] pb-3">
<div class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#231429]">Release source</div>
<div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#594c5e] mt-0.5">github.com/ApueXI/aisley-app-*</div>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-[#e5dce7] pb-3">
<div class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#231429]">Installation guidance</div>
<div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#594c5e] mt-0.5">Read the release notes and instructions</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#231429]">Device compatibility</div>
<div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#594c5e] mt-0.5">Check the package requirements</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
